# U5 (9e0eab41): what counts as input behind a paste's end marker, at the
# composer. An empty paste with a slash command, an Enter and a second end
# marker behind it runs nothing and leaves the draft as it was
# (app_input_runtime.zig:9399-9418@481104fd). Then a paste with an arrow key
# and a whole second paste behind it: the first is kept, the arrow is not
# obeyed and the second paste is not taken (paste_framing.zig:102-107).
fx: env FX_AUTO_UPGRADE=0
wait 4
type keep
wait 0.5
type [200~[201~/version[201~
wait 1.5
snap version-behind
type [200~ new[201~[A[200~two[201~
wait 1.5
snap paste-behind
snapfull paste-behind
gwlog
